1
00:00:00,773 --> 00:00:02,483
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
She ran past me.

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:05,320
(Howard's Mother(voice):)Was I supposed to tackle her?

3
00:00:06,946 --> 00:00:10,116
(Penny:)So I just came by
to see how you were doing.

4
00:00:10,616 --> 00:00:12,536
(Howard:)I'm fine.

5
00:00:12,702 --> 00:00:14,282
(Leonard:)Good.

6
00:00:14,787 --> 00:00:16,207
(Penny:)Your mom seems nice.

7
00:00:16,956 --> 00:00:20,126
(Howard:)People move away from her on the bus.

8
00:00:22,002 --> 00:00:23,042
(Howard:)What do you want?

9
00:00:24,338 --> 00:00:26,798
(Penny:)Okay, look, Howard...

10
00:00:27,049 --> 00:00:30,719
(Penny:)...I just want to apologize.

11
00:00:33,139 --> 00:00:35,729
(Penny:)For some things that I have said.

12
00:00:38,102 --> 00:00:39,312
(Penny:)About you.

13
00:00:41,772 --> 00:00:44,232
(Penny:)I've been informed
that you have feelings...

14
00:00:47,319 --> 00:00:49,449
(Penny:)...and apparently, I have hurt them.

15
00:00:50,906 --> 00:00:52,786
(Penny:)So I'm sorry.

16
00:00:54,827 --> 00:00:56,407
(Penny:)Howard.

17
00:00:58,289 --> 00:01:01,669
(Howard:)Fine. You're sorry. Goodbye.

